61.15z\" fill=\"#fbbc05\"/><path d=\"M256 113.86c34.65 0 65.76 11.91 90.22 35.29l67.69-67.69C373.03 43.39 319.61 20 256 20c-92.25 0-172.07 52.89-210.9 130.01l78.85 61.15c18.56-55.78 70.59-97.3 132.05-97.3z\" fill=\"#ea4335\"/><path d=\"M20 20h472v472H20V20z\"/></g></symbol></svg><div class=\"grw-row grw-row-m\" data-options='{&quot;speed&quot;:&quot;5&quot;,&quot;autoplay&quot;:false,&quot;mousestop&quot;:false,&quot;breakpoints&quot;:&quot;1200:3,768:2,480:1,1024:3,3000:3,1200:3&quot;}'><div class=\"rpi-slides-root grw-content\"><div class=\"grw-content-inner\"><button class=\"rpi-ltgt rpi-lt grw-prev\" tabindex=\"0\"></button><div class=\"rpi-slides grw-reviews rpi-slides-bite\" data-count=\"7\" data-offset=\"7\"><div class=\"rpi-slide grw-review\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd grw-round\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-row12-center\"><div class=\"grw-img-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"grw-img\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUcGCHf8Fu-eJWn_OdVptU2iqjy_OT2nCYPASHuOPVfmfaUvD_x=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"liat berko profile picture\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" onerror=\"if(this.src!='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';\" ></div><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col6\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112509132274748200330/reviews\" class=\"wp-google-name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">liat berko</a><div class=\"wp-google-time\" data-time=\"1744139940\" data-lang=\"en\">1 year ago</div></div></div><span class=\"rpi-stars\" style=\"--rating:5\"></span><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col4\"><div class=\"wp-google-feedback grw-scroll\"  style=\"height:auto!important\"><span class=\"wp-google-text\">Amazing place to recover balance into life and lead valuable tools to heal from within..<br /><br />I was there with my son, who was diagnosed with a brain tumour and couldn’t get up from bed when we arrived there, he had bad habits of eating junks and not exercising.<br /><br />After 4 weeks at Hippocrates riding his bike, happier, more energised and understanding the values of healthy habits toward his recovery as going through an operation is not an option anymore!<br /><br />Thank you Brian, Anna-Maria and team for everything that you do!</span></div></div><svg height=\"16\" width=\"16\" role=\"none\"><use href=\"#grw-google\"/></svg></div></div><div class=\"rpi-slide grw-review\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd grw-round\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-row12-center\"><div class=\"grw-img-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"grw-img\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKNYVsJdm7fkaW6ObeHG1YjxLgFTJb6iImP2EvosIcO74E7mA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Vika Krasnov profile picture\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" onerror=\"if(this.src!='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';\" ></div><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col6\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102460485394221566077/reviews\" class=\"wp-google-name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Vika Krasnov</a><div class=\"wp-google-time\" data-time=\"1743529043\" data-lang=\"en\">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class=\"rpi-stars\" style=\"--rating:5\"></span><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col4\"><div class=\"wp-google-feedback grw-scroll\"  style=\"height:auto!important\"><span class=\"wp-google-text\">I would highly recommend a stay here!! My stay was amazing and the person who went out of her way to make it so was Tedina Bodder!! Thank you Tedina, for trying so hard!! Thank you for rearranging schedules for endless hours so you could make my stay better!! I am not sure if my experience would be as nice if it was not for Tedina!!<br />Thank you Tedina Bodder for taking care of our whole group and making sure we had everything we needed!</span></div></div><svg height=\"16\" width=\"16\" role=\"none\"><use href=\"#grw-google\"/></svg></div></div><div class=\"rpi-slide grw-review\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd grw-round\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-row12-center\"><div class=\"grw-img-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"grw-img\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXeinUPfStlT3hbJdsMlzDPqqDvYZHD-g6rIVR-EvUrF26uEoug=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"ROI STRATEGIES profile picture\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" onerror=\"if(this.src!='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';\" ></div><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col6\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115486470971810635311/reviews\" class=\"wp-google-name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">ROI STRATEGIES</a><div class=\"wp-google-time\" data-time=\"1743307404\" data-lang=\"en\">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class=\"rpi-stars\" style=\"--rating:1\"></span><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col4\"><div class=\"wp-google-feedback grw-scroll\"  style=\"height:auto!important\"><span class=\"wp-google-text\">I don’t understand why the tongs are placed in the bowl on top of the food????? They should have tong holders next to every bowl to place back down it’s disgusting peoples dirty hands touch the tongs and then place them back on top of the food???? Your a multi-million dollar facility, get another table to space out room for the tong holders and buy them!!!!! That is absolutely disgusting and for a health and wellness center you should know better. Only respond to my review once you’ve gone ahead and implemented this change so I can come back and actually sit down for lunch and remove my review. I have autoimmune disorder and lymphatic cancer. I can’t afford to get sick with Covid, measles and candida going around!!!!!!!! This is basic stuff and should be an easy fix within 1 week!!!!</span></div></div><svg height=\"16\" width=\"16\" role=\"none\"><use href=\"#grw-google\"/></svg></div></div><div class=\"rpi-slide grw-review\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd grw-round\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-row12-center\"><div class=\"grw-img-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"grw-img\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUqOHGPyn0QssRzv_3kt-eLVsdlQLV9NHYET1qhpeRc1Np5o771=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Nadine Psareas profile picture\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" onerror=\"if(this.src!='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';\" ></div><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col6\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114288675185870739286/reviews\" class=\"wp-google-name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Nadine Psareas</a><div class=\"wp-google-time\" data-time=\"1740268650\" data-lang=\"en\">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class=\"rpi-stars\" style=\"--rating:5\"></span><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col4\"><div class=\"wp-google-feedback grw-scroll\"  style=\"height:auto!important\"><span class=\"wp-google-text\">It as if I died and went to heaven… spent 3 weeks in paradise, surrounded by unconditional love and vitality in its purest form… and then… after 3 weeks, God sent me back home to earth.</span></div></div><svg height=\"16\" width=\"16\" role=\"none\"><use href=\"#grw-google\"/></svg></div></div><div class=\"rpi-slide grw-review\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd grw-round\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-row12-center\"><div class=\"grw-img-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"grw-img\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXRsCsYDWITw69ESqIA9Wa3BkrRD5jqyMHuUYI6AarsgbWbM7Et=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"chris ryman profile picture\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" onerror=\"if(this.src!='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';\" ></div><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col6\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115365549614130426313/reviews\" class=\"wp-google-name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">chris ryman</a><div class=\"wp-google-time\" data-time=\"1739718849\" data-lang=\"en\">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class=\"rpi-stars\" style=\"--rating:5\"></span><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col4\"><div class=\"wp-google-feedback grw-scroll\"  style=\"height:auto!important\"><span class=\"wp-google-text\">Excellent medical facilities. Helpful staff. Adrian helped me with a live time experience. Josh was great and the lectures were informative. The psychologist and psychiatrist were helpful. The rooms were very clean and spacious</span></div></div><svg height=\"16\" width=\"16\" role=\"none\"><use href=\"#grw-google\"/></svg></div></div><div class=\"rpi-slide grw-review\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd grw-round\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-row12-center\"><div class=\"grw-img-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"grw-img\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxtWvXnc_ekugt4GcLaRB4qe5L42YtJ67G_mZo98GItm-ErTY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"jelani de leon profile picture\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" onerror=\"if(this.src!='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';\" ></div><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col6\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103212591853165465609/reviews\" class=\"wp-google-name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">jelani de leon</a><div class=\"wp-google-time\" data-time=\"1736256564\" data-lang=\"en\">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class=\"rpi-stars\" style=\"--rating:5\"></span><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col4\"><div class=\"wp-google-feedback grw-scroll\"  style=\"height:auto!important\"><span class=\"wp-google-text\">HHI has thought of every detail to ensure their guests have a top notch experience; all while attending to their well being. That’s impressive in my opinion. Other places may do one or the other. Hippocrates has figured out how to do both. On top of that the staff are nice people. I was always greeted with a smile or a hello from the grounds keepers to the directors themselves.<br />Taking care of self while feeling pampered to me is the best vacation I can have. It’s not going to be affordable for everyone but for those who can swing it, it’s money well spent. The food is wholesome and clean so you can indulge guilt free and still lose weight. The grounds are beautifully tended. The hot/cold plunge pools are so therapeutic. There are saunas throughout the campus which make detoxification easy. The fitness area is quite ample for a good daily workout. The exercise classes are great!!! I loved the Nuro-size classes that work on your brain.&#x1f44f;&#x1f3fd;&#x1f64c;&#x1f3fd;<br />They really have thought of everything and made it easy indulge in wellness.</span></div></div><svg height=\"16\" width=\"16\" role=\"none\"><use href=\"#grw-google\"/></svg></div></div><div class=\"rpi-slide grw-review\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd grw-round\"><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-row12-center\"><div class=\"grw-img-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"grw-img\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWOmmS-DEcEKl74Oq9sNoyU7RO7jGkANnCsI0twIGNYPK1fsE_y=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Tom O&#039;Ryan profile picture\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" onerror=\"if(this.src!='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';\" ></div><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col6\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109426662176293455142/reviews\" class=\"wp-google-name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Tom O&#039;Ryan</a><div class=\"wp-google-time\" data-time=\"1731429338\" data-lang=\"en\">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class=\"rpi-stars\" style=\"--rating:5\"></span><div class=\"rpi-flx rpi-col4\"><div class=\"wp-google-feedback grw-scroll\"  style=\"height:auto!important\"><span class=\"wp-google-text\">Hippocrates Wellness is hands-down unlike any other place. If you're serious about taking control of your health and want access to top experts, cutting-edge facilities, and transformative programs, this is where you need to be. I just wrapped up their 21-day Life Transformation Program, and it was a game-changer for me. The whole experience—from the raw, plant-based food to the advanced therapies—helped me feel better than I have in years. The lectures, fitness sessions, and time with the specialists gave me solid, practical insights I could actually use in daily life. The staff were incredibly supportive and made sure I felt right at home on their beautiful campus. I left feeling recharged, sharper, and more connected to my health. Can’t recommend it enough for anyone ready to step up their wellness game.</span></div></div><svg height=\"16\" width=\"16\" role=\"none\"><use href=\"#grw-google\"/></svg></div></div></div><button class=\"rpi-ltgt rpi-gt grw-next\" tabindex=\"0\"></button><div class=\"rpi-dots-wrap\"><div class=\"rpi-dots\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>"}